flowchart TD
  a[Define 8 categories and<br/>labeling guideline v1.0] --> b[Write templates and seeds<br/>in English, Filipino, Taglish]
  b --> c[Generate the synthetic train set<br/>300 emails, template-based]
  b --> d[Team writes the dev and test sets<br/>30 + 100 hand-written emails]
  c --> e[AI-assisted gold labels:<br/>category, priority, register,<br/>TASK and DATE spans, calendar]
  d --> e
  e --> f[Second labeler labels the<br/>test set blind]
  f --> g[Cohen kappa and<br/>weighted kappa computed]
  g --> h{Disagreements}
  h -- "adjudicated per guideline" --> i[3 gold priorities<br/>corrected from 3 to 2]
  i --> j[(Frozen splits<br/>train, dev, test)]
  h -- "accepted" --> j
  j --> k[Dev: every tuning choice]
  j --> l[Test: final evaluation only]
  x[No real user mail is used<br/>Google API Limited Use] -.-> c
